	(text "JP1 is OVP selection only. R7 stays 5.23 ohm for BOTH panels: nominal 38.24 mA total. No high-current mode.\nNo shunt: 10.39 V nominal fallback; NOT a hard OFF. CTRL shutdown/filter delay and open-load peaks need measurement.\nB LOW = 14.94 V provisional; B maximum Vf and absolute ratings are not supplied. See sheet 4 before fitting power links."
